{"title":"Scroll Blizzard","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Bogling, Bog, Reaver, Virikh</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Teaches</b> Blizzard, a level-4 Ice spell. Needs 40 Intellect and Ice skill 25 to learn and to cast.</p><p><b>Drops from monsters that cast Ice spells, level 30+.</b></p><ul class=\"wp-list\">\n          <li>A monster that casts spells drops scrolls of its own school, so look for Ice casters.</li>\n          <li>The monster’s level picks the spell level: <b>8+</b> drops level-2 scrolls, <b>18+</b> level-3 and <b>30+</b> level-4.</li>\n          </ul>\n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"reaver\" title=\"Reaver - dropped it in 1 of 17 looted corpses (1/17)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/e4f2bddfb547f2d8fdf7.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Reaver</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/17<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh\" title=\"Virikh - dropped it in 1 of 143 looted corpses (1/143)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4dbed39ea4505123159.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/143<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bog\" title=\"Bog - dropped it in 1 of 572 looted corpses (1/572)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fe582e27e9d83b3d3f96.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bog</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/572<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bogling\" title=\"Bogling - dropped it in 1 of 1,171 looted corpses (1/1,171)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/40fefc5bf6085eae0053.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bogling</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,171<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"scroll-blizzard\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/89f9dc0356926f71c73f.svg\" alt=\"Scroll Blizzard\"></div><h3>Scroll Blizzard</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>4 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/20/2026, 8:43:24 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}